01:03:49.880 --> 01:03:53.510
just because it's a lot of work and it's not,
you know, you need more help than one person

01:03:53.510 --> 01:03:55.309
to organize a conference.

01:03:55.309 --> 01:03:58.329
Yeah, I've learned to ask for help.

01:03:58.329 --> 01:04:01.359
I have people that help me with some stuff,
but there are some things that I genuinely

01:04:01.359 --> 01:04:02.480
enjoy doing right now.

